# Warehouse Keeper's Pastime (Q384), level 40: a bet of a hundred wins no line of the board 234567891 and the draw gives the sword. Untraced: the reference scrambles the board with an unseeded shuffle, so the random line pins the eight scramble draws (all 0 give the board 234567891) and the expected pages are the datapack pages filled by the reference algorithm.
