  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=cliff item=0 html="<html><body>Warehouse Freightman Cliff:<br>\nLuck is not with you, my friend! The red-colored numbers on the panel below are the ones you chose. They didn't create even a single line! Actually, it's harder not to create a single line than to create all 3 lines!<br>\nUsually, I don't give a reward when you don't create a single line, but I feel sorry for you. Wait here...<br>\n.<br>\n.<br>\n.<br>\nTake this. I hope it will help improve your luck!<br>\n<table border=\"1\" border color=\"white\" width=100> \n\t<tr>\n\t\t<td align=\"center\"><font color=\"ffffff\">2</font></td>\n\t\t<td align=\"center\"><font color=\"ff0000\">3</font></td>\n\t\t<td align=\"center\"><font color=\"ff0000\">4</font></td>\n\t</tr><tr>\n\t\t<td align=\"center\"><font color=\"ff0000\">5</font></td>\n\t\t<td align=\"center\"><font color=\"ffffff\">6</font></td>\n\t\t<td align=\"center\"><font color=\"ff0000\">7</font></td>\n\t</tr><tr>\n\t\t<td align=\"center\"><font color=\"ff0000\">8</font></td>\n\t\t<td align=\"center\"><font color=\"ff0000\">9</font></td>\n\t\t<td align=\"center\"><font color=\"ffffff\">1</font></td>\n\t</tr> \n</table>\n</body></html>\n"
